# accounts, audit, ai, levels, sentences

## auth options and registration
options before any user: GET /api/auth/options -> 200 [application/json] {"bootstrap":true,"emailCodeLogin":false,"emailPolicy":"off","mfaEnforced":false,"passwordMinLength":10,"passwordReset":false,"registration":"closed","totpAvailable":false}
options: GET /api/auth/options -> 200 [application/json] {"bootstrap":false,"emailCodeLogin":false,"emailPolicy":"off","mfaEnforced":false,"passwordMinLength":10,"passwordReset":false,"registration":"closed","totpAvailable":false}
register while closed: POST /api/auth/register -> 403 [application/json] {"error":"registration_closed","message":"Registration is closed. Ask an administrator for an invite link or an account."}

## audit
as user: GET /api/admin/audit -> 403 [application/json] {"error":"forbidden","message":"Administrator access is required."}
bad limit: GET /api/admin/audit?limit=0 -> 400 [application/json] {"error":"bad_request","message":"limit must be between 1 and 100."}
bad before: GET /api/admin/audit?before=x -> 400 [application/json] {"error":"bad_request","message":"before must be an event id."}
page: GET /api/admin/audit?limit=2 -> 200 [application/json] {"events":[{"id":1,"at":"<ts>","action":"user_created","actor":{"id":1,"name":"admin"},"target":{"id":2,"name":"bob"},"detail":{"forced":false}}],"next":null}
all: GET /api/admin/audit -> 200 [application/json] {"events":[{"id":1,"at":"<ts>","action":"user_created","actor":{"id":1,"name":"admin"},"target":{"id":2,"name":"bob"},"detail":{"forced":false}}],"next":null}

## ai
delete key: DELETE /api/ai/keys/anthropic -> 204 [] 
delete unknown provider key: DELETE /api/ai/keys/nope -> 204 [] 
delete custom provider as user: DELETE /api/ai/custom-providers/custom-x -> 403 [application/json] {"error":"forbidden","message":"Only an admin can do that."}
delete unknown custom provider: DELETE /api/ai/custom-providers/custom-x -> 409 [application/json] {"error":"provider_disabled","message":"This provider is turned off by the server."}

